  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Campaign for Debt Reduction and Struggle Against Poverty</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Progress is made towards the establishment of a transparent international mechanism with civil society participation that works for debt revision and decision-taking on reduction in debt servicing or the cancellation of unpayable or questionable debts.

Effective processes and mechanisms for civil society participation in budgeting processes and monitoring of social spending are strengthened in order to meet basic needs, in particular any related to the external debt.</narrative>
  </description>
